# model-fallback-sticky-audit
owner: klerik · cadence: each new session start · status: SUGGESTED
**I see you just fixed model/TTS/vision session-boundary config — want a loop that audits fallback_providers and auxiliary.* pins in every profile so this surprise doesn't recur?**

## Prompt
Run a profile-by-profile audit: confirm fallback_providers lists the user's preferred model first, auxiliary.compression and auxiliary.vision are pinned explicitly, and tts resolution can force fresh entitlement checks; post one NEEDS-CHRIS card for any profile that drifts.

## Evidence
> If I pick a model from The model picker that it should stay with that model until it needs to fall back.
> The main-model switch takes effect in a new session; this one stays on its current model.
